  unitName: Leviathan
  unitId: 20112
  unitNumber: 138
  description: The Devil of the Sea, feared by sailors since ancient times. Not only
    ferocious and violent, but also very intelligent and able to talk with humans.
    However, since Leviathan has judged humans as evil that pollutes the sea, it
    sends every ship it meets to a watery grave. Sailors fear seeing it and always
    offer prayers and sacrifices before setting sail.
  summonDesc: My name is Leviathan.<br>You have a noble ambition.<br>I will lend
    you strength.
  fusionDesc: My strength is needed again?<br>If so, I need more sacrifices!
